commit 334142586e026b50b6e2c1c8d731a1547ed7e8de
Author:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 16:16:53
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 16:16:53

    fix: keep overlay edits and Global inherit on the raw document
    
    SetRules wrote a filled UI copy into Config while only recording the
    changed overlay key, so a missing-rules scope showed other modules
    on after a single toggle. Rebuild the effective config from the raw
    merge, and copy unsaved Global field edits into the preview document.

